-- PREDICTION (decision_log): rows 72, 74, 82, 98, 99, 100, 61 and 7 reach verified within about 4 hours of the steward tick after merge; a PR that breaks a gate's property fails fast-guards instead of reaching main; fm-e2-credential-missing-claim, fm-h5-owner-restart-handoff and fm-objective-revision-unanswered read 0 and stay 0.
